<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 PE - Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekorre</book>
  <para style="h">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba ra2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba rochipiri</para>
  <para style="mt1">raPITA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Tsamba rochipiri raPita </char> rinonyaira kuti ridonyohwa noNhumwa Pita, asi nyanzvi dzizinji dzoBhaibhiri dzanasi hadzifunge kuti nzvochokwadi. Zvinogoneka kuti umwe munhu adonyora panzvimbo yaPita. Munyori anoti ipfakazi idoona upenyu hwaJesu kunyanya anojajanura zvokusanduka (2 Pita 1:17-18) Kana Pita ari adonyora tsamba anogona kunge adorinyorera kuRoma kumakore yari pakati pomakumi matanhatu nomashano kusvika pamakumi matanhatu nomapfemba musure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu, iye Pita asinati wapfa, Pita anoridaidza kuti itsamba rache rochipiri (2 Pita 3:1) achiisa nguwa yokunyora musure motsamba rokuthanga raPita. Tsamba iri adorinyorera maKhirisitu vese.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita adonyora tsamba rakareri kuitira kukurudzira vatendi kuti vararame upenyu hudonaka nokuvabaira zani kuti vareke kutevera vadzidzisi vomabhwodo (2 Pita 2:1-22) Adovakurudzira kuti vareke kutetekera vanhu vanoti Jesu wachehwa kudzoka. Pachinzvimbo chozvakarezvo anotonangidza kuti Mwari anochehwaba asi anoda kuti munhu wese aponesewe (2 Pita 3:8-9). Ichi ndochikonzero chokuraramira upenyu hudonaka (2 Pita 3:14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Pita anozvizivisa achibva wabata vaverengi vache (2 Pita 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Achibva wavayeuchidza kurarama upenyu hudonaka ndava Mwari adotigonesa zvakarezvo (2 Pita 1:3-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinotevera anovachenjedza pamusoro povadzidzisi vomabhwodo achitaura zvichaitika kuvadzidzisi vomabhwodo pakupedzisira (2 Pita 2:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvo Pita anopedzisa nokukurudzira vatendi kuti vararame upenyu hudonaka vachigadzirira kudzoka kwaJesu kwochipiri (2 Pita 3:1-17)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Kubva kuna Simoni Pita, muranda nonhumwa yaJesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Kuno avo vadotambira kutenda kunokosha kudoenzana nokwedu mukururama kwaMwari wedu noMuponisi Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Mutsa norunyararo mbazviingidzihwe kwamuri kuburikidza nokuziva Mwari naJesu Ishe wedu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudaidza kwaMwari noSarudzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Masimba yache youmwari yadotipasa zvese zvatinoda muupenyu hwoumwari kuburikidza nokumuziva iye adotidaidza nokubhwinya nokunaka kwache. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Kuburikidza nozvakarezvi adotipasa zvivimbiso zvache zvikuru zvinokosha, kuitira kuti kuburikidza nazvo mupukunyuke kubva pahuori huri munyika hunokonzehwa nozvido zvidoipa mukovehwe umwari. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Nochikonzero chakarechi, edzai nopamunokona napo pese, kuti muingidzire buya pakutenda kwenyu, nopabuya ruzivo, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />noparuzivo kuzvidzora, nopakuzvidzora kuchiirira, nopakuchiirira umwari, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />nopaumwari kufarira abiyenyu, nopakufarira vabiyenyu rudo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ndava kana zvinhu zvakarezvi munazvo zvichimbondoingidzika, zvichakubisai pakuva vanhu vadondogara vasinai zvibereko pakuziva kwenyu Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ndava kana munhu asinai zvakarezvi, irombe risingaone kurefu, futi wakangamwa kuti adosukiwa zvitema zvache zvomumasure.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Saka, hama dzangu, edzai zvidosimba kuti kudaidziwa nokusaruriwa kwenyu kuve pachokwadi. Ndava kana muchiita zvinhu zvakarezvi, munombweraba, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />futi muchanyanyitsa kutambihwa muumambo hwokusingapere hwaIshe naMuponisi wedu Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Saka ndichida kukuyeuchidzai zvinhu zvakarezvi nguwa dzese, kana zvenyu muchizviziva uye mudomira zvidosimba muchokwadi chamunacho zvino. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ndinofunga kuti zviri mushe kana ndichiri mumuiri uno kuti ndimutsiridze kufunga kwenyu. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Sezvo ndichiziva kuti kusunhuriwa kwangu pamuiri uno kwava papfupi, sezvandidonangidziwa naIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ndichaita zvese zvandinokona kuti kana ndaenda mudzokwanisa kuramba muchiyeuka zvinhu zvakarezvi nguwa dzese.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfakazi Dzidoona Kubhwinya kwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Patidokuzivisai zvosimba nokuuya kwaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, hatinai kutevera zvinzano zvidopakasiwa nouchenjeri, asi taitova pfakazi dzidoona ukuru hwache. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Ndava paadotambira kuremekedzewa nokubhwinya kubva kuna Mwari Baba, izvi ridouya kwaari noKubhwinya Kukuru, richiti, “Wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana wangu, wandinoditsitsa ndinofadziwa naye maninge,” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />isisu pachedu tidorinzva izvi rakareri ridobva kudenga tinaye pagomo rinoyera.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Pakare tinoshoko rochiporofiti rino chokwadi chikuru, futi munoita mushe kana muchiritetekera, semwenje unovhenekera murima, kusvikira kwaakuda kuchena nonhanda yabirika ichivhenekera mumwoyo yenyu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Chokuthangitsitsa munofanira kunzvitsitsa kuti hapanai Gwaro rochiporofiti ridondouya nokurapanura kwomunhu, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />ndava chiporofiti hachinai kuvamba kubva pachido chomunhu, asi vanhu vainyaira zvichibva kuna Mwari vachitungamihwa naMweya Mutsvene waMwari.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Vadzidzisi Vomabwodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Asi vaporofiti vomabwodo vadomukawo pakati povanhu, sezvavachavapowo vadzidzisi vomabwodo pakati penyu. Vachapinza kabisira dzidziso dzinoparadza, vachitoramba naIshe adovatenga, vachizvikokera kuparadziwa kunosvika chivhurumukira. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Vazinji vachatevera nzira dzavo dzinonyadzisa, nondava yavo nzira yochokwadi ichashohwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Panhafu yavo vadzidzisi vakareva vachakutsotsai nomashoko yomabwodo. Kutongewa kwavo kudovapo kare, uye kuparadziwa kwavo kudotosumudza musoro.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Mwari haanai kuregerera ngirozi pakutadza kwadzidoita, asi adodzikhandira mugehena, ndokudziisa mumakomba yorima, kuti dzichengetewe kusvikira pakutongewa. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Futi haanai kusiya nyika yokare paadouyisa mafashamu pavanhu vadoipa, asi adoponesa Nowa, muparidzi wokururama, novamwe vanomwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Mwari adotonga maguta yoSodhoma noGomora nokuyapisa yachiva rota, achiyaita muenzaniso wozvichadzoitika kuno vasinganamate. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Adonunura Roti, murume adorurama, wanga wasembuhwa noupenyu hwoutsambwa hwovanhu vasinai mutemo. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Munhu iyeyo adorurama, waigara pakati pavo zuva nozuva, waitsvisiwa mwoyo wache udorurama nondava yozviito zvokusakudza Mwari zvaaiona nokunzva. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Izvozvi zvinonangidza kuti Ishe anoziva manunuriro yaanoita munamati kubva pamiedzo nokuchengeta vasinai kururama vari pamurango kusvikira pazuva rokutongwa, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />kunyanyitsa vaye vanotevera kuchiva kwoutsambwa hwomuviri yavo vachishora vanomasimba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Havache, vanochivindi, vanoda kushora vaye vanokubhwinya. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ngirozi, kana zvadzene dzinosimba rikurufuti hadzinenere mhosva vanhu vadodai pamberi paIshe. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Asi vanhu vakareva vanenge mhuka dzisinai hwenye, dzidosikihwa kubatiwa nokubaiwa, vanoshora zvinhu zvavasinganzvitsitse. Vachaparadziwawo kunge mhukadzo, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />vachitambudzika nokuda kwokutadza kwavo. Vanofarira kuita zvinovagutsa masikati machena, madondorozi yanoshoreka pavanobatana naimimi pakuja! <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Vanomeso yadozara upombwe, vanorekeraba kutadza, vano mwoyo idopingudzihwa nhafu. Vanofurira vasinai kutsiga mbana vadoshurikidziwa! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Vadosiya nzira idorungama ndokutetereka vachitevera nzira yaBharamu mwanakomana waBhoeri, waifarira mubairo wozvidoipa. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Asi manje pakunyangadza kwacheko adodzumiwa noburu, chipuka chisinganyaire, chidonyaira nodzinga romunhu chichirambidza kupenga kwomuporofiti.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Vanhu vakareva nzvithubu zvisinai mvura nopfurere inogwididzihwa noduthu. Rima ridosvipitsaro ndiro ravadochengetehwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Nokuti nokuzvikudza vanonyaira zvoudzemwa, vachifurira vatsva vachandopunyuka kubva panovanorarama mukutadza kunodiwa nomuviri. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Vanovavimbisa rusununguko, asi ivo pachavo vari varanda vouori, ndava chese chinokurira munhu, wava muranda kwachiri. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Ndava kana vadombopukunyuka tsambwa yomunyika kuburikidza nokuziva Ishe wedu noMuponisi Jesu Kirisitu, vakadzokundiwa vachisungiwa nayo kamu, pakupedzisira vanenge vasokokerafuti kukunda pakuthanga. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ndava zvanga zvichitova hasa kwavari dai vasinai kuziva nzira yokururama, panokuti vabva kuiziva vodzoperekera gotsi kukuraira kutsvene kwavadopasiwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Zvidoitika kwavari setsumo inoti, “Imbwa inodzokera kumarutsi yayene, nohumba yanga yashambidziwa inodzokera pakuumburuka mumatope.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Chivimbiso choKuuya kwaIshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Vadikani, iri rava tsamba rangu rochipiri kwamuri. Mayari yese ndidonyora iri yeuchidzo yokukumutsai mufungo udochena, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />ndinoda kuti muyeuke mashoko yadonyaihwa mumasure novaporofiti, nomurairo waIshe naMuponisi kuburikidza nonhumwa dzenyu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Chokuthanga, munofanira kunzvitsitsa kuti mumazuva yokupedzisira vaseki vachauya vachiseka nokuzvidza. Vachitevera zvido zvavo zvidoipa <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />vachiti, “Chiri poi chivimbiso chokuuya kwache? Ndava chipfiro chidoita madzibaba yedu, zvinhu zvese zviri paugariro hwazvene kubva pachisikihwo!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Vanokangamwa utova kuti matenga nonyika zvanga zviripo kare zvidoitiwa noshoko raMwari, nonyika idoitiwa nomvura uye kubva mumvura, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />futi kuburikidza nomvura yakareyo nyika yanga iripo idonyudziwa nokuparadziwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Noshoko ribodzibodziro matenga nonyika zvazvino zvidochengetehwa zuva rokutonga norokuparadziwa kwovanhu vasinai umwari.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Hama dzinodikana rekai kukangamwa chinhu ichi chibodzi, kuti kuna Mwari zuva ribodzi rinenge chiuru chomakore nochiuru chomakore chinenge zuva ribodzi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Ishe anochehwaba pachivimbiso chache semanzvitsitsiro yovamwe vanoti nghuchehwa, asi anomwoyo murefu nemi, anodaba kuti pawane anoparara, asi kuti vese vasvike pakupinduka.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Asi zuva raIshe richauya sembavha. Ipopo matenga yachapfuura noruzha rikuru, nozvinhu zviri kumatenga zvichanyungudutsiwa nomoto, nonyika nomabasa yese yari mairi yachatsva. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Sezvo zvinhu zvese zvazvichaparara daipa, munofanira kuva vanhu vadoita tini? Munofanira kurarama upenyu hutsvene hunoumwari, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />mudomirira zuva raMwari rinokurumidza kusvika. Zuva rakarero richauyisa kuparadziwa nomoto kwomatenga, nozvinhu zvayene zvichanyungudika nochithuthu chikuru. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Asi maererano nochivimbiso chache tinotarisira denga ritsva nonyika itsva, munogara kururama.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Saka, hama dzangu, sezvo mudomirira zvakarezvi, edzai chaizvo kuti akuwanei musinai dondorozi kana chamunonenehwa, uye munorugare naye. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Mbazvive mupfungwa dzenyu kuti mwoyo murefu waIshe wedu unoreva ruponiso, sezvamudonyorehwa naPhauro hama yedu inodikana muuchenjeri hwaadopasiwa naMwari, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />anonyora nonzira ibodzibodziyo mutsamba dzache dzese, achinyaira zvinhu zvakarezvi madziri. Tsamba dzache dzinozvinhu zvidooma kunzvitsitsa, izvo zvinophidigutsiwa novasingazive novasinai kudiha, sezvavanoita noyamwe Magwaro kuti vaparadziwe nazvo.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Nokudaro, hama dzangu, sezvo izvi muchizviziva, chenjererai kuti mureke kukukuhwa nokuphonya kwovanhu vasingachengete mutemo muchiwa kubva panzvimbo yamudochengeteka. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Asi kurai pamutsa nomuruzivo raIshe wedu naMuponisi Jesu Khirisitu. Kwaari mbakuve kubhwinya kubva zvino nokusingapere! Ameni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>